# Phase 0.42 — LiteParse layout-preserving adapter (private/optional addon).
# Kept OUT of public repo: deployed to Linux VPS via scp; absent on most clones.
# Registry + bootstrap both guard with file_exists() so vắng file = no-op.
/core/kg-hub/includes/adapters/class-liteparse-adapter.php
/core/kg-hub/includes/adapters/liteparse-sidecar.py
/core/diagnostics/includes/probes/class-probe-liteparse.php

# R-AGENT-PARITY — private agent instructions and generated local indexes.
# Public counterparts: .github/copilot-instructions.md, .github/instructions/
# agent-environment.instructions.md, docs/AGENT-DOC-CATALOG.md, AGENTS.md.
/.github/copilot-instructions.local.md
/.github/instructions/*.local.instructions.md
/docs/AGENT-DOC-CATALOG.local.md
/CLAUDE.local.md

# R-DIAG-LOCAL (D-35, 2026-09-28) — LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY: never uploaded to a VPS, never committed to GitHub.
# Full list: bin/dev-only-paths.txt · rule: docs/rules/PHASE-0-RULE-DIAGNOSTICS-DEV-LOCAL.md.
# core/diagnostics = Diagnostics engine, probes, diagnostic pages/REST (the schema changelog moved to core/helper/schema/);
# tests = PHPUnit, fixtures, baselines; _notes = reduction snapshots/tarballs.
# Production never requires them (is_file + Safe_Loader / class_exists guards). CI `shipped-tree` fails if
# core/diagnostics or tests is tracked. Commits are made from the VPS: upload this .gitignore with every change,
# and if a path was ever committed run `git rm -r --cached <path>` once there.
/core/diagnostics/
/tests/
/_notes/
# [2026-09-30 Claude Opus 5.5] R-LEAN-4 WP-16 B-1 — nested harness/unit folders are dev-local too (bin/dev-only-paths.txt).
**/tests/
